ame>Beaman</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Tammariello</surname><given-names>RF</given-names></name></person-group><year>1992</year><article-title>Susceptibility of selected strains of <italic>Aedes aegypti</italic> and <italic>Aedes albopictus</italic> (Diptera: Culicidae) to Chikungunya virus.</article-title><source>J Med Entomol</source><volume>29</volume><fpage>49</fpage><lpage>53</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1313111</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001168-Hamon1"><label>14</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hamon</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>1953</year><article-title>Etudes biologique et syst&#x000e9;matique des <italic>Culicinae</italic> de l'Ile de La R&#x000e9;union.</article-title><source>M&#x000e9;m Inst Sc Madagascar</source><volume>E4</volume><fpage>521</fpage><lpage>541</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001168-Salvan1"><label>15</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Salvan</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mouchet</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><year>1994</year><article-title><italic>Aedes albopictus</italic> et <italic>Aedes aegypti</italic> &#x000e0; l'Ile de La R&#x000e9;union.</article-title><source>Ann Soc Belge M&#x000e9;d Trop</source><volume>74</volume><fpage>323</fpage><lpage>326</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0001168-Coulanges1"><label>16</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coulanges</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Clerc</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Jousset</surname><given-names>FX</given-names></name><name><surname>Rodhain</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Hannoun</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name></person-group><year>1979</year><artic